Type: Package
Package: MeshUtils
Title: Utility Functions for Meshes Based on 'CGAL'
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
  c(person("Daniel", "Wollschlaeger", role=c("aut", "cre"), email="wollschlaeger@uni-mainz.de"),
    person("Stéphane", "Laurent", role=c("aut")))
Maintainer: Daniel Wollschlaeger <wollschlaeger@uni-mainz.de>
Description: An adaptation of code from packages 'Boov', 'PolygonSoup',
    and 'cgalMeshes' developed by Stéphane Laurent.
    Basic processing of 3D meshes as well as Boolean operations
    (union, difference and intersection) using as backend
    the 'C++' library 'CGAL' <https://www.cgal.org/>.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/dwoll/MeshUtils/
BugReports: https://github.com/dwoll/MeshUtils/issues/
Depends:
    R (>= 2.10)
Imports:
    data.table,
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.9),
    rgl,
    Rvcg
LinkingTo:
    BH,
    Rcpp,
    RcppCGAL,
    RcppEigen
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
SystemRequirements: C++ 17, mpfr
Roxygen: list(markdown=TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
